{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52819","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 席豫","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南山四皓德，东海二疏名。\n功遂知身退，心微觉道成。\n霓裳明主赐，鹤驾列仙迎。\n诏饯出中野，朋欢留上京。\n灞桥春水溢，稽岭白云生。\n此去三千里，那堪长别情。\n（见宋孔延之编《会稽掇英总集》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"席豫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}